# ElAbogato OS - translation template
#
# How to translate:
# 1. Translate only the text AFTER each = sign. Do not change the keys on the left.
# 2. Keep placeholders such as {title}, {name}, {language} and {author} unchanged.
# 3. Save the file as <your language code>.lang (for example fr.lang).
# 4. Send it to ElAbogato: upload it to the lang folder of the GitHub repository
#    or send it by Discord direct message together with an icon image so you can be credited.
#
# Translator name or nickname:
# Language name written in your own language:
# Language code:

